    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>The below Hazards include all Hazards likely to occur in Jungle, Forest, and Swamp environments: </p><table class=\"sortable wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>KEYWORDS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sucking_Mud\" title=\"Sucking Mud\">Sucking Mud</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Leeches\" title=\"Leeches\">Leeches</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Low-Hanging_Branches\" title=\"Low-Hanging Branches\">Low-Hanging Branches</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thornbushes\" title=\"Thornbushes\">Thornbushes</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Animal_Trap\" title=\"Animal Trap\">Animal Trap</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Artificial, Contact </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flash_Moss\" title=\"Flash Moss\">Flash Moss</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Area, Contact, Energy, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Insect_Swarm\" title=\"Insect Swarm\">Insect Swarm</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flooded_River\" title=\"Flooded River\">Flooded River</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/